+   * line at the knee, decreases strictly and stays positive, so a smaller penalty always scores
+   * higher; in the tail the relative score change equals the relative change of {@code knee + t}.
+   */
+  static double softFloorScore(double penalty, double knee) {
+    double kneePenalty = 1000.0 - knee;
